---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Contact"
  description="Get in touch with Kula Gardos for inquiries, group bookings, or feedback"
>
  <style>
    .content {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 3rem 1rem;
    }

    .contact-container {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }

    .location-map {
      min-height: 520px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .location-map iframe {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      min-height: 520px;
      border: 0;
    }

    .contact-info {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .info-section {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--secondary-color), rgba(44, 24, 16, 0.8));
      color: white;
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .info-section h3 {
      color: var(--primary-color);
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .info-section p {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .info-section a {
      color: var(--primary-color);
    }

    .info-section a:hover {
      color: white;
    }

    .social-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .social-links a {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      background-color: rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.3);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .social-links a:hover {
      background-color: var(--primary-color);
      color: var(--secondary-color);
    }

    @media (max-width: 968px) {
      .contact-container {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .faq {
      background-color: var(--light-bg);
      padding: 2rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }

    .faq-item {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .faq-item h4 {
      color: var(--accent-color);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .faq-item p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }
  </style>

  <div class="content">
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p>
      Have questions? Want to book a group visit? Or just want to share your experience? 
      We'd love to hear from you!
    </p>

    <div class="contact-container">
      <div class="location-map">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Kula+Gardo%C5%A1%2C+Zemun%2C+Belgrade%2C+Serbia&output=embed"
          title="Google Maps location of Kula Gardoš"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-info">
        <div class="info-section">
          <h3>📍 Location</h3>
          <p><strong>Kula Gardos</strong></p>
          <p>Gardos Hill, Grobljanska bb</p>
          <p>Zemun, Belgrade 11000</p>
          <p>Serbia</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-section">
          <h3>📞 Contact Details</h3>
          <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+381116190169">+381 11 619 01 69</a></p>
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@gardos.rs">info@gardos.rs</a></p>
          <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.gardos.rs" target="_blank">www.gardos.rs</a></p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h4>❓ Can we arrange group visits?</h4>
        <p>Yes! We accommodate groups of 20 or more. Contact us for special group rates and guided tour arrangements.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h4>❓ Is the fortress wheelchair accessible?</h4>
        <p>Most areas of the fortress are accessible. We recommend calling ahead to discuss any specific accessibility needs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h4>❓ Are photography and videography permitted?</h4>
        <p>Yes, personal photography is welcome. For commercial or professional photography, please contact us in advance.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h4>❓ Can we host private events at the fortress?</h4>
        <p>The fortress may be available for special events. Please inquire about availability and requirements.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h4>❓ How long does a typical visit last?</h4>
        <p>Most visitors spend 1-2 hours exploring. This allows time to climb the tower, view exhibits, and enjoy the panoramic views.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
